Files: opt/texas2step/venv/lib/python3*/site-packages/texas2step/documents/*
Copyright: none
License: public-domain
Comment: The text each download starts with: the Declaration of Independence and the
 Constitution of the United States (National Archives transcriptions), the Texas
 Declaration of Independence and the Constitution of the Republic of Texas (Wikisource
 transcriptions), and the Texas Constitution as amended (Texas Legislative Council).
 Each file names its source.

License: public-domain
 Founding documents and constitutions: the laws and charters of governments, free of
 copyright, and in the case of the 1776, 1787 and 1836 texts long out of it.

